{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島のイベントに来てくださるかたへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み村というところに是非行ってみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB 48さんの総選挙を見ました！\n感動して泣いちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人の言葉が物凄く心にしみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大島優子さんと前田敦子さんの花束を渡して力強く抱き合うシーンは涙が込み上げました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも......\n大島優子さんの最後のセリフは最後まで聞きたかったですなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB 総選挙を見ながら想うことはたくさんありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も皆様がいるから頑張れる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って！思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しスタート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 豚ちゃんまで貰ったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A いえ、ありがと！\nって打ったら、ありが豚って変換のところに出たから使ってみた☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qマキシワンピ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A あっ！確かそうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q久しぶり過ぎて誰かわかんないっしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A わかったよー！でもほんとーに久しぶりですねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q思いきってバッサリいっちゃいますか？でも事務所的に大丈夫なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A いっちゃいたいーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 狼に口笛を      目回らないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 全然大丈夫ですよーーん！しんぱいしてくれてありがとー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q広島のお土産ってなんだろー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A もみじまんじゅうかなぁ？\nでも最近はきびだんごをあげます！\nでもきびだんごは岡山なんですけどねー！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qユッキーナママなのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 私の事赤ちゃんってよぶんじゃぁ(*_*)ニョホホーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qここまで伸ばすのに何年かかったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 五年生位からきってないかなぁ？ニヒヒ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ショートにしたことあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A あるぜぇ！\nワイルドだろー！にこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q夏に向けてマジで切っちゃおうと思ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 切りたいです！\nですからこの前あしゅかとウィッグ屋さんにいきましたよー！キラーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q何でも似合いそうだからいろいろちょうせんしてみたら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aありがとー！大好きー！嬉しいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qかわごってぃも同じ場所で写したのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A そうだよー！まあやんちでパシャリしてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q運動会や体育祭の思い出聞かせて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A いつもリレー選手！キラーン\n走るとき小指立ってた！わはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q その服のブランドってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A とっても言いにくいのですがぁ...スパーの隣にあったとても安い服屋さんで購入いたしました(((^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ミツアミとかするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 最近は全然してないなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qコーラ味のミルク？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 雲ちゃん(みくも)のコーラを飲みました！雲ちゃんには内緒で！にこっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qコメント雑になりがち。誤字、脱字が多くて反省ばかり、それでもよんでくれてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 読んでるよー何回も読んでるよー！書いてくるだけで嬉しいです♪ありがとー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qこの横になっているのは絵か？写真じゃなくて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A げっ？(￣▽￣;)わかんない_(^^;)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ウサギかったことないけど飼うの大変？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 大変だけど可愛いから！わら\nウサギかわいいよー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q カツ丼や天丼すき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 好きまではいかないかもー(>_<)←正直でスミマセン\nでも、メッチャ疲れたときに食べたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qろってぃは写真好き？絵画すき？\n自分では撮影しないよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A あぁ確かにそうですねぇー★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qウサギは東京で買ってるの？\n一匹だけ飼っても大丈夫なの？\n日中ウサギだけにして出掛けても大丈夫なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 一匹だけ飼っても大丈夫です！      日中ウサギだけにしてお出掛けはウサギちゃんは可哀想だけど...そんなときもあります(>_<)          広島です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qお父さんはやさしいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A めちゃくちゃやさしいでっせー！\nわちゃーーーっ☆\nお父さんみたいな旦那さんを見つけると幸せだろうなぁ(*´∀｀*)にゃへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 食べれんのは損してるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A してます！\nぞひとももう一度お好み焼きチャレンジしてください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q じめじめとした梅雨をどう乗りきろうと考えてる？広島の夏は瀬戸の夕なぎと言って非常に蒸し暑い印象があるけど知ってた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 乗り切り方ー？うーん考えてない！\n知らなかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ラグチャンは走るの早い？人より早い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 早いけど人よりとかはどうだらー？\nめっちゃすばしっこいよっ★(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qたこ焼きのタコは食べれるようになりましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A この前間違えて食べました！\n間違えんと食べれん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q憧れてる人ってだれなんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A う〜ん！安室奈美恵さん！AKB 48さん！AAA さんですかなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君もそう思ってくれてるとまあやは嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでNEWS"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わだまあやは！！！乃木坂浪漫の撮影に行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会楽しみですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も貴方が大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/07/4781500/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}